                {
                  "type": "quiz",
                  "question": "A patient with a deviated nasal septum from a prior car accident undergoes septoplasty to correct the deformity and improve nasal breathing. Which root operation should be assigned?",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "text": "Alteration (0) — because the nose is being modified",
                      "correct": false
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Reposition (S) — because the septum is being moved to its normal location",
                      "correct": true
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Excision (B) — because cartilage is being trimmed",
                      "correct": false
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Supplement (U) — because the septum is being reinforced",
                      "correct": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "explanation": "Septoplasty for a **deviated septum with breathing impairment** has a **functional purpose** — restoring normal airflow. **Alteration (0) is excluded** because there is a medical indication beyond appearance. The dominant action is **repositioning** the displaced septal cartilage to its normal anatomic location, making **Reposition (S)** the correct root operation. Code: **095K0ZZ** — Ear/Nose/Sinus (9), Reposition (S), Nasal Septum (K), Open (0). If small cartilage portions were also excised to allow repositioning, an additional Excision code may be needed per the operative report.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Functional septoplasty</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"190\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">NOT ALTERATION</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Functional indication —</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">improves nasal breathing</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Alteration is for</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">cosmetic ONLY</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Medical purpose excludes</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Alteration root op</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"190\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">REPOSITION (S)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">\"Moving to its normal</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">location or other</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">suitable location.\"</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Septal cartilage moved</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">to midline = Reposition</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"600\" width=\"1000\" height=\"370\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">CORRECT CODE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"44\">095K0ZZ</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">0 = Med/Surg | 9 = Ear/Nose/Sinus</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">S = Reposition | K = Nasal Septum</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">0 = Open | Z = No Device</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Z = No Qualifier</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Functional intent excludes Alteration"
                  }
                }
